          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="explain">
          <div class="ev">
            <span class="mk">How to read this</span>
            <p>Read it beside the export plate. Electronics appears on both: India imports components and finished goods while exporting assembled phones, so a rise in electronics exports usually comes with a rise in electronics imports.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="now">
            <span class="mk">As of {T.groups.lastFy}</span>
            <p>The largest import groups were <span id="ex-b-1">–</span>, <span id="ex-b-2">–</span> and <span id="ex-b-3">–</span>.</p>
