          <div class="plotzone"><div id="plot-chapx" style="position:relative"></div></div>
          <div class="plotfoot">
            <span class="src">Source: Ministry of Commerce, TradeStat (DGCI&amp;S), MEIDB: March tables, April-to-March totals.</span>
            <span class="dl"><button data-dl="svg">SVG</button><button data-dl="png">PNG</button><button data-dl="csv">CSV</button><a href="https://tradestat.commerce.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source</a></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="explain">
          <div class="ev">
            <span class="mk">How to read this</span>
            <p>A chapter is the customs code's broadest shelf: chapter 27 is all mineral fuels, crude and products alike; chapter 85 is electrical machinery, from phones to transformers; chapter 71 is pearls, stones, jewellery and gold. The every-cut table at the end of this guide opens each chapter into its headings and tariff lines.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="now">
            <span class="mk">As of {T.chapters.exports.fy}</span>
            <p>The top export chapter was <span id="ex-c-x1">–</span> at <b id="ex-c-x1v">–</b>, then <span id="ex-c-x2">–</span> at <b id="ex-c-x2v">–</b>.</p>
